<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>印度最富有的公民机构将向零售买家开放债券销售</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers</link><description>印度最富有的孟买市政当局计划通过未来的债券销售吸引个人投资者，为城市基础设施项目提供融资。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers'&gt;印度最富有的公民机构将向零售买家开放债券销售&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India’s Richest Civic Body Will Open Bond Sales to Retail Buyers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:59:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>波兰总统阻止选举前减税，对图斯克造成新打击</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/polish-president-blocks-pre-election-tax-cut-in-new-blow-to-tusk</link><description>波兰总统卡罗尔·纳罗基否决了削减个人所得税的立法，这对唐纳德·图斯克在明年大选前为部分选民提供经济救济的努力构成了新的打击。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/polish-president-blocks-pre-election-tax-cut-in-new-blow-to-tusk'&gt;波兰总统阻止选举前减税，对图斯克造成新打击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Polish President Blocks Pre-Election Tax Cut in New Blow to Tusk&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/polish-president-blocks-pre-election-tax-cut-in-new-blow-to-tusk</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Codelco在最新的重组中将商业老板让给了Trafigura</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/codelco-extends-management-shake-up-with-new-commercial-boss</link><description>Codelco 首席商务官 Braim Chiple 辞职，出任托克集团 (Trafigura Group) 职务，这是这家智利国有铜生产商在新任首席执行官豪尔赫·戈麦斯 (Jorge Gómez) 领导下的最新管理层变动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/codelco-extends-management-shake-up-with-new-commercial-boss'&gt;Codelco在最新的重组中将商业老板让给了Trafigura&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Codelco Loses Commercial Boss to Trafigura in Latest Shakeup&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/codelco-extends-management-shake-up-with-new-commercial-boss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:29:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Assets Surge as Lula Taps Trabuco as Finance Minister&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</link><description>德意志交易所股份公司 (Deutsche Boerse AG) 以 53 亿欧元（58 亿美元）收购 Allfunds Group Plc 的交易已获得欧盟无条件批准，为这家德国交易所运营商历史上最大的收购铺平了道路。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval'&gt;德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deutsche Boerse’s €5.3 billion Allfunds Bid Gets EU Approval&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>